This should contain the following files:

> vars.sh, with the following values:
    export FLASK_KEY=
    export DASHBOARD_LOGIN=
    export DASHBOARD_PASSWORD=
    
    # For the DNS update (I use Andy's) used in dns-update.py
    export DNS_TOKEN=
    export DNS_LOGIN=
    export DNS_DOMAIN=
    export DNS_SUBDOMAIN=
    export DNS_URL=

>server-name.sh, with the following line
    export ZOMBOID_SERVER="servertest" # Or whatever name your .ini file is named

>status, (literally just that) will be created automatically, and tracks the current server status, used by server-dashboard communication.

# Dashboard SSL stuff
> key.pem, with the secret key for the https certificate



